# type(scope): subject   ← ≤ 100 chars, imperative ("add", not "added")
#
# types: feat fix docs refactor perf test build ci chore revert
# scope: a domain or area: main, navigation, localization, vision, base, tools, docker, ci
# add "!" after the type/scope for breaking changes: feat(base)!: rename pose topic
#
# Body: WHY the change was needed and what it affects (wrap at 72).
# Tested: how (sim / robot white, overlay id, ditx test).
#
# Refs: #123
# BREAKING CHANGE: <what users of the old behaviour must do>
#
# Enable once:  git config commit.template .gitmessage
